\item[S1] ULAM.AI, \emph{UnsolvedMath}, supplied \texttt{problems.json}, record 1466 (MOD-009), statement and background. The embedded literature-review date is 2026-08-17; that is the archive’s review date, not a fresh certification. Dataset landing page: \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.

\item[S2] K. Krupiński, P. Tanović and F. O. Wagner, Around Podewski's conjecture, Fund. Math. 222 (2013), 175--193; arXiv:1201.5709. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1201.5709}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

\item[S3] K. Krupiński, On Podewski's conjecture. \url{https://www.math.uni.wroc.pl/~kkrup/minifield3.pdf}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

\end{itemize}

